# domains/identity — Identity & Access domain core

Owners: Platform team, Identity squad (identity: @nexora/platform)

Scope: the Identity & Access bounded context (DOMAIN_MODEL.md §2.2) — User,
Session, and Role aggregates, value objects, domain events, repository
interfaces, domain services, and policies.

Rules:
- NO persistence, NO APIs, NO HTTP, NO authentication implementation, NO
  JWT/OAuth. This package is the pure business domain (ROADMAP.md Phase 1).
- Dependencies are limited to: @nexora/contracts, @nexora/shared. Do not add
  others.
- The PasswordHasher is a PORT — the domain defines the contract, the
  infrastructure layer supplies the implementation. Never hash here.
- Reuse the canonical contracts and shared utilities; never duplicate them.
- Domain events must ride the shared envelope with category `identity`.
- Contract changes require a compatibility review.
